(6985203, 1053978, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful building. I googled it--lots of architectural photos of it, not many art photos, nothing as good as yours. This is impressive!</td>', 'This is a beautiful building. I googled it--lots of architectural photos of it, not many art photos, nothing as good as yours. This is impressive!', '2013-02-24 12:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
