(6985838, 1054376, 100495, '<td valign="top">I love the ''drama'' but this is as horrible as photos get. In a good way.</td>', 'I love the ''drama'' but this is as horrible as photos get. In a good way.', '2013-02-25 09:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6985844, 1053948, 100495, '<td valign="top">This is truly epic. There''s a really strong feeling of movement and mystery. It''s easy to see that a lot of work went into the post production.</td>', 'This is truly epic. There''s a really strong feeling of movement and mystery. It''s easy to see that a lot of work went into the post production.', '2013-02-25 09:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6985925, 1054317, 49954, '<td valign="top">Cute idea and well done, but not symmetrical at all (as I''m sure you''ve heard many times by now)<br/><strike> <br/>Had to give this a 1 for DNMC.  Normally I would -3 but since in this case, the theme was a hard and fast rule totally within the control of the photographer, I''m forced to be a little more harsh.</strike> <br/> <br/>Upon reflection, this is an example of rotational symmetry, so I take back the DNMC and score this for the image itself.  Well, done!  a 7</td>', 'Cute idea and well done, but not symmetrical at all (as I''m sure you''ve heard many times by now) Had to give this a 1 for DNMC.  Normally I would -3 but since in this case, the theme was a hard and fast rule totally within the control of the photographer, I''m forced to be a little more harsh.  Upon reflection, this is an example of rotational symmetry, so I take back the DNMC and score this for the image itself.  Well, done!  a 7', '2013-02-25 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6985990, 1054371, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like the interesting little "face" at the bottom of the tree limb and at the crook of the branch. This has a lot going for it - richly detailed, soft background but a very sharp image in the foreground.  A really good image - should place in the Top Five if not win.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the interesting little "face" at the bottom of the tree limb and at the crook of the branch. This has a lot going for it - richly detailed, soft background but a very sharp image in the foreground.  A really good image - should place in the Top Five if not win.  Well done.', '2013-02-25 15:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6985991, 1053899, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very clever take on the challenge - different and a little outside the box.</td>', 'Very clever take on the challenge - different and a little outside the box.', '2013-02-25 15:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6985992, 1053982, 101256, '<td valign="top">Ok, that''s just flat out creepy - I LOVE IT!!!  Top Ten for sure.</td>', 'Ok, that''s just flat out creepy - I LOVE IT!!!  Top Ten for sure.', '2013-02-25 15:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6985995, 1054298, 101256, '<td valign="top">Perfect title, richly detailed, terrific and deep tonal features - well done - a very seamless image mirror.</td>', 'Perfect title, richly detailed, terrific and deep tonal features - well done - a very seamless image mirror.', '2013-02-25 15:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6985998, 1054088, 101256, '<td valign="top">The amazing thing about this image is the incredible depth - it''s almost like 3D in someways - very difficult to achieve in a black and white conversion. This is a lesson in composition and conversion that one doesn''t see often. Beautifully detailed, the blacks, grays and whites are perfect - beautiful imagery.  Personally, I''d call this the winner - but it''s not up to me. Well done.</td>', 'The amazing thing about this image is the incredible depth - it''s almost like 3D in someways - very difficult to achieve in a black and white conversion. This is a lesson in composition and conversion that one doesn''t see often. Beautifully detailed, the blacks, grays and whites are perfect - beautiful imagery.  Personally, I''d call this the winner - but it''s not up to me. Well done.', '2013-02-25 16:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6985999, 1054046, 101256, '<td valign="top">HA!! Love it.  Very clever albeit a little scary. Pretty good and very clever. Nicely done.</td>', 'HA!! Love it.  Very clever albeit a little scary. Pretty good and very clever. Nicely done.', '2013-02-25 16:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986001, 1054274, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant, an excellent image. More like a impressionist pencil drawing than a photo.  I really like this - abstract without being overly abstract if that makes any sense. Well done.</td>', 'Simple and elegant, an excellent image. More like a impressionist pencil drawing than a photo.  I really like this - abstract without being overly abstract if that makes any sense. Well done.', '2013-02-25 16:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986004, 1053860, 101256, '<td valign="top">Rather simplistic and overly tall image. The sky doesn''t go this image any favors as it is.  An improvement might be to crop a 1/3rd off the bottom to give it some pop and detail. Removing the bottom 1/3rd makes it a much better image in my opinion.</td>', 'Rather simplistic and overly tall image. The sky doesn''t go this image any favors as it is.  An improvement might be to crop a 1/3rd off the bottom to give it some pop and detail. Removing the bottom 1/3rd makes it a much better image in my opinion.', '2013-02-25 16:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986006, 1054273, 101256, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully rich earth tones, beautiful sky, a plethora of shapes and sizes - a top Ten image for sure if not a top Five. Richly detailed, but not overdone in any sense of the word.  Well done.</td>', 'Wonderfully rich earth tones, beautiful sky, a plethora of shapes and sizes - a top Ten image for sure if not a top Five. Richly detailed, but not overdone in any sense of the word.  Well done.', '2013-02-25 16:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986007, 1054409, 101256, '<td valign="top">Spatial forms frozen in time is about the only way to describe this - very clever use of standard imagery to make something completely new. Well done.</td>', 'Spatial forms frozen in time is about the only way to describe this - very clever use of standard imagery to make something completely new. Well done.', '2013-02-25 16:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986009, 1054148, 101256, '<td valign="top">The reductive quality of the spatial relationships is very evident in this image - an almost fractal like quality - might almost say Escher in context.  The conversion is terrific - nothing over done, whites right on the edge - beautiful image.  Well done.</td>', 'The reductive quality of the spatial relationships is very evident in this image - an almost fractal like quality - might almost say Escher in context.  The conversion is terrific - nothing over done, whites right on the edge - beautiful image.  Well done.', '2013-02-25 16:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986013, 1054376, 101256, '<td valign="top">As an advocate of the Aesthetic in photographic imagery, I feel that the qualities of the designated sexual signifier details the devious simplicity of this image. Elegance is not always complex in nature and this image proves it. A very worthy entry into the challenge - I''d like to see this a Top Five. Well done.</td>', 'As an advocate of the Aesthetic in photographic imagery, I feel that the qualities of the designated sexual signifier details the devious simplicity of this image. Elegance is not always complex in nature and this image proves it. A very worthy entry into the challenge - I''d like to see this a Top Five. Well done.', '2013-02-25 16:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986019, 1054386, 101256, '<td valign="top">The negative space enhances the devious simplicity and transitional quality of the components of this image. It is truly amazing the amount of detail and depth in this image - the conversion is perfect, nothing is over done or overly strong.  An excellent artistic representation of a orchid.</td>', 'The negative space enhances the devious simplicity and transitional quality of the components of this image. It is truly amazing the amount of detail and depth in this image - the conversion is perfect, nothing is over done or overly strong.  An excellent artistic representation of a orchid.', '2013-02-25 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986025, 1054373, 101256, '<td valign="top">I love it - I''m a huge fan of abstract color imagery, in particular the types of weird shapes one can get playing with reverse images. This is absolutely beautiful - gorgeous.  Probably not to everyone''s taste, but hey - that''s what makes the world go ''round. Well done.</td>', 'I love it - I''m a huge fan of abstract color imagery, in particular the types of weird shapes one can get playing with reverse images. This is absolutely beautiful - gorgeous.  Probably not to everyone''s taste, but hey - that''s what makes the world go ''round. Well done.', '2013-02-25 16:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986063, 1053854, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''ve said before that I''m not a big fan of HDR, but this is a terrific example of how to do it right.  Very symmetrical with lots of detail. Great color tonality and detail.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'I''ve said before that I''m not a big fan of HDR, but this is a terrific example of how to do it right.  Very symmetrical with lots of detail. Great color tonality and detail.  Very nicely done.', '2013-02-25 17:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986065, 1053948, 101256, '<td valign="top">Can''t really comment - this is simply beautiful - an amazing image.</td>', 'Can''t really comment - this is simply beautiful - an amazing image.', '2013-02-25 17:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986068, 1054246, 101256, '<td valign="top">HA!! Love it.  Out of the box thinking is sometimes lacking in these challenges, but this is stellar. What a terrific idea - very clever. Well done.</td>', 'HA!! Love it.  Out of the box thinking is sometimes lacking in these challenges, but this is stellar. What a terrific idea - very clever. Well done.', '2013-02-25 17:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986073, 1054093, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another clever composition. I think it might be a little too busy though - it''s hard to get an overall impression without isolating one section to view in detail - the symmetry concept is to view the image as a whole and not in part. Still, a very clever idea and concept. Nicely done.</td>', 'Another clever composition. I think it might be a little too busy though - it''s hard to get an overall impression without isolating one section to view in detail - the symmetry concept is to view the image as a whole and not in part. Still, a very clever idea and concept. Nicely done.', '2013-02-25 17:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986080, 1054267, 101256, '<td valign="top">One of the problems is that there are so many images in this challenge that just jump out at you, this one takes some time to properly parse. Very Rorschach in concept - you stare at it for a while and it begins to make sense. A pretty good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'One of the problems is that there are so many images in this challenge that just jump out at you, this one takes some time to properly parse. Very Rorschach in concept - you stare at it for a while and it begins to make sense. A pretty good entry into the challenge.', '2013-02-25 18:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986083, 1054253, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is one of those images where a reviewer can be a real ass or can be honest in evaluating it''s merits - a good news, bad news kind of thing. So, the good news is that from an artistic standpoint, it is a very good composition. From a technical standpoint, it doesn''t quite make the grade.  The juxtaposition of the two skeletons is flawed at the bottom and top of the image which creates a false impression of sloppy post processing. I know what the author was trying to convey, but it just doesn''t work - for me that is. Others may differ. But to be fair, it''s worth a 7 because of the effort to create it and it''s artistic merit.</td>', 'This is one of those images where a reviewer can be a real ass or can be honest in evaluating it''s merits - a good news, bad news kind of thing. So, the good news is that from an artistic standpoint, it is a very good composition. From a technical standpoint, it doesn''t quite make the grade.  The juxtaposition of the two skeletons is flawed at the bottom and top of the image which creates a false impression of sloppy post processing. I know what the author was trying to convey, but it just doesn''t work - for me that is. Others may differ. But to be fair, it''s worth a 7 because of the effort to create it and it''s artistic merit.', '2013-02-25 18:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986086, 1054311, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another interesting abstract - very impressionist is concept and execution. The lighting appears to be perfect with no over done color or white space. A really nice image.</td>', 'Another interesting abstract - very impressionist is concept and execution. The lighting appears to be perfect with no over done color or white space. A really nice image.', '2013-02-25 18:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986095, 1054324, 101256, '<td valign="top">Clever composition - I can''t find where the image is joined - that''s impressive.  Well done.</td>', 'Clever composition - I can''t find where the image is joined - that''s impressive.  Well done.', '2013-02-25 18:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986096, 1053746, 101256, '<td valign="top">Terrific conversion to gray scale. Very subtle lighting and accents - love the fades on the central image. A very worthy entry into the challenge - well done.</td>', 'Terrific conversion to gray scale. Very subtle lighting and accents - love the fades on the central image. A very worthy entry into the challenge - well done.', '2013-02-25 18:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986098, 1054404, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is a concept in psychology called <b>postural mirror-image mirroring</b> which occurs when one person''s left side "matches" the other person''s right side showing strong rapport and typically affinity or empathy and increasing synchronicity with someone. This is a great image that reflects that concept perfectly. An excellent entry.  Well done.</td>', 'There is a concept in psychology called postural mirror-image mirroring which occurs when one person''s left side "matches" the other person''s right side showing strong rapport and typically affinity or empathy and increasing synchronicity with someone. This is a great image that reflects that concept perfectly. An excellent entry.  Well done.', '2013-02-25 18:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986100, 1053913, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is something really creepy about these Cyclops images. In this case, it''s very creepy which makes it a great concept and composition. Very nicely done.</td>', 'There is something really creepy about these Cyclops images. In this case, it''s very creepy which makes it a great concept and composition. Very nicely done.', '2013-02-25 18:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986101, 1054106, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another seamless join in a mirror image. Really well done - can''t find a thing to nit pick. Well done.</td>', 'Another seamless join in a mirror image. Really well done - can''t find a thing to nit pick. Well done.', '2013-02-25 18:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986105, 1054288, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another beautiful abstract type image - I''ve done something similar to this with my old fire place in New England. I really like experimenting with flame imagery. This is terrific. Well done.</td>', 'Another beautiful abstract type image - I''ve done something similar to this with my old fire place in New England. I really like experimenting with flame imagery. This is terrific. Well done.', '2013-02-25 18:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986106, 1053867, 101256, '<td valign="top">Had to look at this for a minute to see where the symmetry was, but I found it - very clever as it causes the viewer to look close and see where it is. What a wonderful concept and terrific execution. Well done.</td>', 'Had to look at this for a minute to see where the symmetry was, but I found it - very clever as it causes the viewer to look close and see where it is. What a wonderful concept and terrific execution. Well done.', '2013-02-25 18:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986107, 1053872, 101256, '<td valign="top">Oh I wish there wasn''t the white blooms in the middle of the center objects - that is just terribly distracting and takes away from the simple elegance of the image. Unfortunate.</td>', 'Oh I wish there wasn''t the white blooms in the middle of the center objects - that is just terribly distracting and takes away from the simple elegance of the image. Unfortunate.', '2013-02-25 18:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986109, 1054272, 101256, '<td valign="top">The real question is which is the front and which is the front. Great image - love it. A ten just for whimsy.</td>', 'The real question is which is the front and which is the front. Great image - love it. A ten just for whimsy.', '2013-02-25 18:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986157, 1053948, 92577, '<td valign="top">works so well and the colors are great - should be a comfortable win</td>', 'works so well and the colors are great - should be a comfortable win', '2013-02-25 20:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986315, 1054263, 152252, '<td valign="top">Cutie. The head is shaped a little bit like a gremlin. I love gremlins. Don''t feed them after midnight though.</td>', 'Cutie. The head is shaped a little bit like a gremlin. I love gremlins. Don''t feed them after midnight though.', '2013-02-26 01:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986317, 1054279, 152252, '<td valign="top">A mutant squirrel. It''s looking at me.</td>', 'A mutant squirrel. It''s looking at me.', '2013-02-26 01:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986422, 1054264, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on symmetry - the same, but different. A very good example of outside the box thinking. This isn''t a manipulated image so it should get high marks for being naturally symmetric - even the lighting from the left is symmetric. Excellent entry.</td>', 'Interesting take on symmetry - the same, but different. A very good example of outside the box thinking. This isn''t a manipulated image so it should get high marks for being naturally symmetric - even the lighting from the left is symmetric. Excellent entry.', '2013-02-26 08:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986425, 1054313, 101256, '<td valign="top">At first I liked this - still do, but the cut and paste is way too obvious as the edges are much too sharp - distracts from the image as a whole. There is also a slight feathering around the cut outs which is the result of over sharpening - or it looks like over sharpening.</td>', 'At first I liked this - still do, but the cut and paste is way too obvious as the edges are much too sharp - distracts from the image as a whole. There is also a slight feathering around the cut outs which is the result of over sharpening - or it looks like over sharpening.', '2013-02-26 08:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986426, 1054222, 101256, '<td valign="top">I wonder if the author noticed the gate like outline at the bottom of the image in the center - that makes the whole difference in this image.  I can imagine this as a cover image for a fantasy novel or horror movie. Really nice image although it''s a little busy around the edges of the central subject. Still, a good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'I wonder if the author noticed the gate like outline at the bottom of the image in the center - that makes the whole difference in this image.  I can imagine this as a cover image for a fantasy novel or horror movie. Really nice image although it''s a little busy around the edges of the central subject. Still, a good entry into the challenge.', '2013-02-26 08:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986427, 1054269, 101256, '<td valign="top">The tire and buoy shadows make this a very attractive image.  The two ropes on the other hand distract from the image - they just look weird where the join was made.  Other than that, it''s a very elegant and simple image that has a great deal of pleasing tones and color. Very nicely done.</td>', 'The tire and buoy shadows make this a very attractive image.  The two ropes on the other hand distract from the image - they just look weird where the join was made.  Other than that, it''s a very elegant and simple image that has a great deal of pleasing tones and color. Very nicely done.', '2013-02-26 08:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986429, 1054012, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little less busy and this would have been a terrific image.</td>', 'A little less busy and this would have been a terrific image.', '2013-02-26 08:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986430, 1054304, 101256, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if the center focus distracts or adds to this image. From an artistic point of view, this is an interesting image and it''s technically competent, I just can''t decide if I like it or not. Always error on the side of the author - in this case an 8 instead of a 6.</td>', 'I can''t decide if the center focus distracts or adds to this image. From an artistic point of view, this is an interesting image and it''s technically competent, I just can''t decide if I like it or not. Always error on the side of the author - in this case an 8 instead of a 6.', '2013-02-26 08:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986431, 1053990, 101256, '<td valign="top">The one little reflected light is over done and ruins the overall effect. Others may disagree, but I think a little less white bloom would have been much better. The color is great - love the earthy tone to it.</td>', 'The one little reflected light is over done and ruins the overall effect. Others may disagree, but I think a little less white bloom would have been much better. The color is great - love the earthy tone to it.', '2013-02-26 08:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986432, 1054291, 101256, '<td valign="top">Looks almost like back scatter interference from a electron microscope. Very simple and elegant - nothing wrong from an artistic or technical standpoint, it is just uninteresting to this observer - no pop or wow factor.</td>', 'Looks almost like back scatter interference from a electron microscope. Very simple and elegant - nothing wrong from an artistic or technical standpoint, it is just uninteresting to this observer - no pop or wow factor.', '2013-02-26 08:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986434, 1054097, 101256, '<td valign="top">HA!! Love it - very clever and another good example of outside the box thinking. Excellent.</td>', 'HA!! Love it - very clever and another good example of outside the box thinking. Excellent.', '2013-02-26 08:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986435, 1054196, 101256, '<td valign="top">I had to come back to this a couple of times as I couldn''t make up my mind if the top of the image works for or against the overall merit of the image.  I''ve settled on work against - everything else just seems to perfect then you view the top and you kind of question why you think that way. I think it''s the imperfection as compared to the rest of the image that is annoying. Also the whites are just a tad over done.</td>', 'I had to come back to this a couple of times as I couldn''t make up my mind if the top of the image works for or against the overall merit of the image.  I''ve settled on work against - everything else just seems to perfect then you view the top and you kind of question why you think that way. I think it''s the imperfection as compared to the rest of the image that is annoying. Also the whites are just a tad over done.', '2013-02-26 08:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986436, 1054057, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting - that thing in the middle looks like some kind of mechanical crab - a crab android from outer space!!  I like it - the subtle color lends a lot of character to this and the middle crab creature looks like it''s being transported from the Enterprise. Well done.</td>', 'Interesting - that thing in the middle looks like some kind of mechanical crab - a crab android from outer space!!  I like it - the subtle color lends a lot of character to this and the middle crab creature looks like it''s being transported from the Enterprise. Well done.', '2013-02-26 08:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986437, 1054317, 101256, '<td valign="top">Love it - clever and funny.</td>', 'Love it - clever and funny.', '2013-02-26 08:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986440, 1054268, 101256, '<td valign="top">Concept is a definite 10. Composition is a 10. Execution - well, it failed spectacularly.  Hell of an idea, but the ragged center with the incomplete white just ruins the whole thing. Sorry.</td>', 'Concept is a definite 10. Composition is a 10. Execution - well, it failed spectacularly.  Hell of an idea, but the ragged center with the incomplete white just ruins the whole thing. Sorry.', '2013-02-26 08:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986441, 1054162, 101256, '<td valign="top">The heck of it is that I can see the face, but the image is much too busy to have a really strong effect which is unfortunate.</td>', 'The heck of it is that I can see the face, but the image is much too busy to have a really strong effect which is unfortunate.', '2013-02-26 08:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986442, 1054098, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good example of being busy, but not overly busy that it loses it''s intended impact. Complex, yet simple and elegant at the same time - very interesting composition.</td>', 'A good example of being busy, but not overly busy that it loses it''s intended impact. Complex, yet simple and elegant at the same time - very interesting composition.', '2013-02-26 08:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6986443, 1054087, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''ll be honest - I don''t get it. This just doesn''t make any sense to me as it seems to miss the point of the challenge - not sure how this is "symmetrical" in the ordinary sense of the word.</td>', 'I''ll be honest - I don''t get it. This just doesn''t make any sense to me as it seems to miss the point of the challenge - not sure how this is "symmetrical" in the ordinary sense of the word.', '2013-02-26 08:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
