(6987607, 1054370, 63218, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1038123" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1171726&amp;highlight=flying%20pig&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">The Flying Pig</a> <br/> <br/>I have enjoyed this, it is a treat to look at because it''s not perfect. At first glance the symmetry is there, but as my gaze lingers I discover many little variations that upset the symmetry. It is this opportunity to look &amp; discover that is a rare delight. Thanks for the treat!<br/> <br/>Also,  because I am familiar with this process, some of the pleasure in looking at this was in trying to figure out how you did it.<br/> <br/>I like the colors, and the title. The variations that upset the symmetry also remind me of being outside, looking in thru the glass panel in the door at the distorted view of what''s inside. Very nice. I don''t get to award very many Flying Pigs, so this is a double treat for me.</td>', ' The Flying Pig  I have enjoyed this, it is a treat to look at because it''s not perfect. At first glance the symmetry is there, but as my gaze lingers I discover many little variations that upset the symmetry. It is this opportunity to look & discover that is a rare delight. Thanks for the treat! Also,  because I am familiar with this process, some of the pleasure in looking at this was in trying to figure out how you did it. I like the colors, and the title. The variations that upset the symmetry also remind me of being outside, looking in thru the glass panel in the door at the distorted view of what''s inside. Very nice. I don''t get to award very many Flying Pigs, so this is a double treat for me.', '2013-02-28 10:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
